=====================================================================
1. Data (data-dash snapshots, and the CO2 series in frame-motion/05)
=====================================================================
Each snapshot file records `pulled_from`, `pulled_at` (2026-10-19 06:52 UTC),
`licence` and the exact query. Values are reshaped only in each spec's SQL.

- data-dash/01-keeling-curve, frame-motion/05-keeling-chart-story:
  NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory, Mauna Loa CO2 monthly means,
  https://gml.noaa.gov/ccgg/trends/ . Freely available U.S. Government work.
  Cite: Lan, X., Tans, P. and K.W. Thoning, NOAA GML; Scripps Institution of
  Oceanography (C.D. Keeling) for data before May 1974.
- data-dash/02-warming-stripes-heatmap: NASA GISS Surface Temperature Analysis
  (GISTEMP v4), https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/ . Public domain (NASA).
  Cite: GISTEMP Team, NASA Goddard Institute for Space Studies; Lenssen et al. 2019.
- data-dash/03-uk-grid-mix: Carbon Intensity API, https://carbonintensity.org.uk/ ,
  National Energy System Operator (NESO). CC BY 4.0.
- data-dash/04-wealth-and-longevity: World Bank World Development Indicators,
  https://data.worldbank.org/ . CC BY 4.0, The World Bank.
- data-dash/05-fireballs: NASA/JPL CNEOS Fireball and Bolide Data API,
  https://cneos.jpl.nasa.gov/fireballs/ . Freely available; credit NASA/JPL-Caltech.
- data-dash/06-near-earth-flybys: NASA/JPL SBDB Close-Approach Data API,
  https://ssd-api.jpl.nasa.gov/doc/cad.html . Freely available; credit NASA/JPL-Caltech.
- data-dash/07-five-cities-one-year: Open-Meteo Historical Weather API,
  https://open-meteo.com/ . CC BY 4.0. Contains modified Copernicus Climate
  Change Service information (ERA5).
- data-dash/08-sky-events-on-wikipedia: Wikimedia pageviews REST API,
  https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/ . CC0 1.0, Wikimedia Foundation.
- data-dash/09-exoplanet-census: NASA Exoplanet Archive,
  https://exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu/ . "This research has made use of
  the NASA Exoplanet Archive, which is operated by the California Institute of
  Technology, under contract with the National Aeronautics and Space
  Administration under the Exoplanet Exploration Program."
- data-dash/10-bakery-ops-example: EXAMPLE DATA, seeded synthetic numbers for
  a fictional bakery. Not real. MIT with the rest of the repo.

Brands, places, channels, festivals and timetables in frame-motion/04, 08, 09
and 10 are fictional.

